    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\dfrac13,-4,4$.",
      "worked": "Let the roots be $\\alpha,-\\alpha,\\beta$.\n\nSum of roots:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\alpha-\\alpha+\\beta&=\\frac13\\\\\\beta&=\\frac13.\\end{align*}$$\nProduct of roots:\n$$\\begin{align*}-\\alpha^2\\beta&=-\\frac{16}{3}\\\\-\\alpha^2\\left(\\frac13\\right)&=-\\frac{16}{3}\\\\\\alpha^2&=16\\\\\\alpha&=\\pm4.\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore $x=\\dfrac13,-4,4$.",
